            <fieldText>&lt;b&gt;Integrations(Google/Microsoft Outlook)&lt;/b&gt;

Logging in to your RingCentral Online Account with Google

&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-left: 40px;list-style-type:square;&amp;nbsp;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Click Google &gt; Log in
&lt;li&gt;Enter your Google email and click Next.&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;b&gt;NOTE&lt;/b&gt;: If your company uses Google G Suite, you will redirected to the Google G Suite login page. Enter your Google G Suite credentials there to proceed.

&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-left: 40px;list-style-type:square;&amp;nbsp;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Enter your password and click Next.&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-left: 40px;list-style-type:blank;&amp;nbsp;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;img src=&apos;https://rc--c.na29.content.force.com/servlet/rtaImage?eid=ka23400000090nh&amp;feoid=00N80000004hxR2&amp;refid=0EM3400000046hI&apos; /&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;



&lt;b&gt;NOTE&lt;/b&gt;: If this is not a first time login, you may just click or enter your Google account and you will be automatically logged in to your RingCentral Online Account. If you have logged out from your Google account, you may need to enter your credentials again. 
