            <name>EscalatethecasetoTier2</name>
            <fieldText>&lt;b&gt;Escalate the case to Tier 2&lt;/b&gt;

&lt;b&gt;Important&lt;/b&gt;: Advice the customer to have their &lt;b&gt;SAML 2.0 metadata&lt;/b&gt; and &lt;b&gt;certificate&lt;/b&gt; ready.

Reminders before escalating the case:

&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-left: 40px;list-style-type:square;&amp;nbsp;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Attach the Metadata to T1 case 
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that your case notes are detailed and concise.
&lt;li&gt;Set expectations with the customer regarding their case being escalated.
&lt;li&gt;Use probing questions to determine if the customer has any other unresolved issues.
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership and appropriate action to ensure unresolved issues are handled correctly
&lt;li&gt;Do not forget to to select the correct disposition based on how you handled the problem&lt;/ul&gt;
 


&lt;b&gt;NOTE&lt;/b&gt;: If the customer has any other questions, Go Back to FAQ&apos;s

For Self-help click the link &lt;a href=&quot;https://success.ringcentral.com/articles/RC_Knowledge_Article/6748&quot;; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Single Sign-On (SSO) - Overview | RingCentral&lt;/a&gt;





Click &lt;b&gt;NEXT&lt;/b&gt; to add notes to an existing case or to create a new case for this issue
